@context: Every form verb — FILL, TYPE, SELECT, CHECK, UNCHECK, radio, UPLOAD — plus strict VERIFY forms and a custom-control date picker.
@title: forms
@tags: regression, forms
@var: {full_name} = Ada Lovelace
@var: {email} = ada@example.com

STEP 1: Text inputs
    NAVIGATE to {base_url}/forms.html
    FILL 'Full name' field with '{full_name}'
    FILL 'Email' field with '{email}'
    TYPE '+380 44 000 0000' into the 'Phone' field
    FILL 'Bio' field with 'First programmer.'
    VERIFY 'Full name' field has value '{full_name}'
    VERIFY 'Search' field has placeholder 'Type to search...'
    VERIFY 'Email' field has placeholder 'name@example.com'

STEP 2: Choices
    SELECT 'Japan' from the 'Country' dropdown
    EXTRACT the 'Country' into {country}
    VERIFY that 'Free' is checked
    CLICK the radio button for 'Pro'
    VERIFY that 'Pro' is checked
    VERIFY that 'Newsletter' is checked
    UNCHECK the checkbox for 'Newsletter'
    VERIFY that 'Newsletter' is NOT checked
    VERIFY that 'Submit' is disabled
    CHECK the checkbox for 'I accept the Terms'
    VERIFY that 'Submit' is enabled

STEP 3: Custom control and upload
    # 'Delivery Date' is a readonly picker; demo/controls.py owns it.
    FILL 'Delivery Date' field with '2026-12-24'
    VERIFY 'Delivery Date' field has value '2026-12-24'
    UPLOAD '../fixtures/avatar.png' to 'Avatar'
    VERIFY that 'Uploaded: avatar.png' is present

STEP 4: Submit
    CLICK the 'Submit' button
    VERIFY that 'Form submitted' is present
    VERIFY that '"plan":"pro"' is present
    VERIFY that '"delivery":"2026-12-24"' is present
    PRINT "Submitted {full_name} from {country}"

DONE.
